    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of a forgotten laboratory, a plant awakens...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spring Escape</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0thrilling 2D platformer about a flower and a piece of dirt, <strong>Patchy and Tulip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in the depths of a destroyed laboratory, this duo sets out to find a way to the surface, a journey where they'll have to prove to be true heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/14d94ba00f6882bc691f0eef18997033.avif?t=1751895652\" data-has-big width=800 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road ahead is filled with obstacles, enemies, challenges, and sorta-helpful allies, will these two find a way out while discovering the truth behind this place, the world outside and themselves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Escape aims to be a <strong>simple, yet packed and extremely enjoyable game</strong>, not breaking new grounds but providing a constant quality and fun experience. With a linear yet compelling story, an exciting campaign and lots of side and post-game content that will have you replay the game in wildly different ways and face brand new threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/84bee755f22abd05e5e3d1555bc74bd8.avif?t=1751895652\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any great platformer worth its name, Spring Escape features a cast of creative and wholly unique bosses, these giants creatures are a major highlight of the game. And don't think they'll stop giving problems past the credits.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of a forgotten laboratory, a plant awakens...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spring Escape</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0thrilling 2D platformer about a flower and a piece of dirt, <strong>Patchy and Tulip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in the depths of a destroyed laboratory, this duo sets out to find a way to the surface, a journey where they'll have to prove to be true heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/14d94ba00f6882bc691f0eef18997033.avif?t=1751895652\" data-has-big width=800 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road ahead is filled with obstacles, enemies, challenges, and sorta-helpful allies, will these two find a way out while discovering the truth behind this place, the world outside and themselves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Escape aims to be a <strong>simple, yet packed and extremely enjoyable game</strong>, not breaking new grounds but providing a constant quality and fun experience. With a linear yet compelling story, an exciting campaign and lots of side and post-game content that will have you replay the game in wildly different ways and face brand new threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/84bee755f22abd05e5e3d1555bc74bd8.avif?t=1751895652\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any great platformer worth its name, Spring Escape features a cast of creative and wholly unique bosses, these giants creatures are a major highlight of the game. And don't think they'll stop giving problems past the credits.</p>",
    "short_description": "An action packed 2D platformer about diving inside dirt and moving through countless obstacles with grace. Will you help Patchy and Tulip reach the surface?",
